OL,3,GNEWSAMadness to play city's summer
OL,4,Aconcert
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers have announced Madness will
OL,7,Fperform the opening concert to raise
OL,8,Fthe curtain on a city's summer
OL,9,Ffestival.
OL,11,FThe band will play at Priory Park in
OL,12,FSouthend-on-Sea on 22 July 2027, the
OL,13,Fday before the Lazydays Festival takes
OL,14,Fplace at the same location.
OL,16,FThe festival returns for its fourth
OL,17,Fyear, with headliners Dizzee Rascal and
OL,18,FKaiser Chiefs already announced.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
