OL,3,GNEWSAMadness to play city's summer
OL,4,Aconcert
OL,5,
OL,6,FMadness lead singer Suggs said it was
OL,7,F"magnificent" to be returning to
OL,8,FSouthend, 18 years since the band's
OL,9,Flast performance in the Essex city.
